{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"陈--Gauss--Bonnet定理"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"陈–Gauss–Bonnet 定理"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $M$ 为紧"},{"Local":{"url":"定向","text":"可定向"}},{"Plain":" $2n$ 维 Riemann 流形, $\\Omega$ 为 $M$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"曲率形式","text":"曲率形式"}},{"Plain":", 则 $M$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Euler示性数","text":"Euler 示性数"}},{"Plain":"可由曲率形式的 Pfaffian 计算:\n$$\r\n\\chi(M) = \\frac{1}{(2\\pi)^n}\\int_M \\operatorname{Pf}(\\Omega).\r\n$$\n这个结论是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Atiyah--Singer指标定理","text":"Atiyah–Singer 指标定理"}},{"Plain":"的特例.</p>\n<p>$\\dfrac{1}{(2\\pi)^n}\\operatorname{Pf}(\\Omega)$ 是流形 $M$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Euler类","text":"Euler 类"}},{"Plain":". 它不依赖于 $M$ 上 Riemann 度量的选取.</p>\n"}]}}